WEBVTT

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:32.454
some great new slang this way,

00:02:32.454 --> 00:02:36.492
including "hangry," which --

00:02:36.492 --> 00:02:40.188
(Applause) —

00:02:40.188 --> 00:02:42.535
which is when you are cranky or angry

00:02:42.535 --> 00:02:46.774
because you are hungry,

00:02:46.774 --> 00:02:51.550
and "adorkable,"

00:02:51.550 --> 00:02:53.257
which is when you are adorable

00:02:53.257 --> 00:02:56.278
in kind of a dorky way,

00:02:56.278 --> 00:02:59.471
clearly, terrific words that fill

00:02:59.471 --> 00:03:02.176
important gaps in the English language.